# 基本図形編集に文字を運んで離す (design 11.3, 10.4), for tools/ui_run.py: a figure of 30 small
# rectangles, two zigzag lines and one piece of text "ABC" (mkbig fig 30 4 1) opened at 100,100
# as 画用紙 is, the piece's box from 210,247 to 330,287 on the screen. A copy of 基本文章編集 of
# two lines (青木 遥, 〒; mkbig doc 1, xmlbig), opened by the text editor's process at 100,100,
# is moved by its name band to 560,360, out of the way of the piece. Its first line, picked from
# Home to Shift+End, is carried onto the figure where nothing is (300,520): a new piece of text
# stands there. The document is brought in front again by its band where the figure does not
# cover it, its second line picked and carried onto the piece "ABC": the letters go into it.
# The figure saved, record 0 is the one the desktop's own figure editor, since removed, made
# of the same letters carried from a document of the desktop's.
# The letters leave the document (a move, not a copy, the figure having been asked first).
# Keys: Home 4A, End 4D (with Shift 02); Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# The desktop's own editor this was once compared with is gone: what it saved and showed
# (record 0, its pictures) is what is wanted of the process here (want, shotsum).
mkbig fig 30 4 1
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 33
wait 500
mkbig doc 1
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>青木 遥</p>
xml <p>〒</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 2
wait 800
drag 550 112 1010 372
wait 500
win 基本文章編集
click 980 375
wait 300
front dp 基本文章編集
expect ok dp: in front
click 600 400
key 4A
key 4D 02
wait 200
logmark
hold 575 400
wait 100
move 560 420
wait 100
move 420 480
wait 100
move 300 520
wait 300
up
